#: ../../library/omv.ulab.numpy.fft.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`numpy.fft` --- Fast Fourier Transform routines"
msgstr ":mod:`numpy.fft` --- 快速傅里叶变换例程"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.numpy.fft.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :mod:`numpy.fft` submodule provides one-dimensional Fast Fourier "
"Transform routines. The length of the input array must be a power of 2; "
"otherwise a ``ValueError`` is raised."
msgstr ""
":mod:`numpy.fft` 子模块提供一维快速傅里叶变换例程。输入数组的长度必须是 2 的幂；否则将引发 ``ValueError``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.numpy.fft.rst:11
msgid ""
"When ``ulab`` is built without complex support, the real and imaginary parts"
" of the transform are kept in separate :class:`numpy.ndarray` objects, and "
"the functions return a 2-tuple ``(real, imag)``. When ``ulab`` is built with"
" the ``ULAB_SUPPORTS_COMPLEX`` and ``ULAB_FFT_IS_NUMPY_COMPATIBLE`` options "
"enabled, the routines accept and return complex arrays in a "
"``numpy``-compatible manner."
msgstr ""
"当 ``ulab`` 在构建时不支持复数时，变换的实部和虚部会保存在两个独立的 :class:`numpy.ndarray` 对象中，函数返回一个二元组"
" ``(real, imag)``\\ 。当 ``ulab`` 在构建时启用了 ``ULAB_SUPPORTS_COMPLEX`` 和 "
"``ULAB_FFT_IS_NUMPY_COMPATIBLE`` 选项时，这些例程将以与 ``numpy`` 兼容的方式接受并返回复数数组。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.numpy.fft.rst:18
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "函数"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.numpy.fft.rst:22
msgid "Compute the one-dimensional discrete Fourier Transform of *r*."
msgstr "计算 *r* 的一维离散傅里叶变换。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.numpy.fft.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.numpy.fft.rst:24
msgid ""
"a one-dimensional array whose length is a power of two. Holds the real part "
"of the input signal."
msgstr "一个长度为 2 的幂的一维数组。保存输入信号的实部。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.numpy.fft.rst:26
msgid ""
"an optional one-dimensional array of the same length as *r*, containing the "
"imaginary part of the input. If omitted, the imaginary part is assumed to be"
" zero."
msgstr "一个可选的一维数组，其长度与 *r* 相同，包含输入的虚部。如果省略，则假定虚部为零。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.numpy.fft.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.numpy.fft.rst:29
msgid ""
"a 2-tuple ``(real, imag)`` of :class:`numpy.ndarray` objects holding the "
"real and imaginary parts of the transform."
msgstr "一个由 :class:`numpy.ndarray` 对象组成的二元组 ``(real, imag)``\\ ，保存变换的实部和虚部。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.numpy.fft.rst
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "引发"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.numpy.fft.rst:31
#: ../../library/omv.ulab.numpy.fft.rst:51
msgid "if the length of the input is not a power of two."
msgstr "如果输入的长度不是 2 的幂。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.numpy.fft.rst:33
msgid ""
"When ``ulab`` is compiled with ``ULAB_SUPPORTS_COMPLEX`` and "
"``ULAB_FFT_IS_NUMPY_COMPATIBLE`` set to 1, the function instead takes a "
"single (possibly complex) array and returns a complex array, in the same "
"manner as ``numpy.fft.fft``."
msgstr ""
"当 ``ulab`` 在编译时将 ``ULAB_SUPPORTS_COMPLEX`` 和 "
"``ULAB_FFT_IS_NUMPY_COMPATIBLE`` 设置为 1 时，该函数转而接受单个（可能为复数的）数组并返回一个复数数组，方式与 "
"``numpy.fft.fft`` 相同。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.numpy.fft.rst:40
msgid "Compute the one-dimensional inverse discrete Fourier Transform."
msgstr "计算一维逆离散傅里叶变换。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.numpy.fft.rst:42
msgid ""
"a one-dimensional array whose length is a power of two. Holds the real part "
"of the spectrum."
msgstr "一个长度为 2 的幂的一维数组。保存频谱的实部。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.numpy.fft.rst:44
msgid ""
"an optional one-dimensional array of the same length as *r*, containing the "
"imaginary part of the spectrum. If omitted, the imaginary part is assumed to"
" be zero."
msgstr "一个可选的一维数组，其长度与 *r* 相同，包含频谱的虚部。如果省略，则假定虚部为零。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.numpy.fft.rst:47
msgid ""
"a 2-tuple ``(real, imag)`` of :class:`numpy.ndarray` objects holding the "
"real and imaginary parts of the inverse transform. The result is normalised "
"by ``N`` (the number of samples), so that ``ifft(fft(x))`` reproduces the "
"original input."
msgstr ""
"一个由 :class:`numpy.ndarray` 对象组成的二元组 ``(real, imag)``\\ ，保存逆变换的实部和虚部。结果按 "
"``N``\\ （样本数）归一化，因此 ``ifft(fft(x))`` 会重现原始输入。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.numpy.fft.rst:53
msgid ""
"When ``ulab`` is compiled with ``ULAB_SUPPORTS_COMPLEX`` and "
"``ULAB_FFT_IS_NUMPY_COMPATIBLE`` set to 1, the function takes a single "
"(possibly complex) array and returns a complex array."
msgstr ""
"当 ``ulab`` 在编译时将 ``ULAB_SUPPORTS_COMPLEX`` 和 "
"``ULAB_FFT_IS_NUMPY_COMPATIBLE`` 设置为 1 时，该函数接受单个（可能为复数的）数组并返回一个复数数组。"
